From ff5fc983e649d473534a28fb6b81b3e1c2bc2ae9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:43:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ChopGimp 3.29.6: complete vector performance: 16/32-bit
 layers converted through float (CHOPGIMP_NO_FAST_FLOAT), parallel
 rasterization of meshes, free gradients, patterns, arrows, stroke gradients
 and width profiles (outlines and pattern cells made beforehand;
 CHOPGIMP_NO_PAR_RENDER_EXT), partial undo sharing the unchanged leaves
 between snapshots and swapping them on undo/redo (CHOPGIMP_NO_PARTIAL_UNDO),
 legacy path rewritten lazily after undo (CHOPGIMP_NO_LAZY_LEGACY)

---
